WEBVTT

00:00:01.011 --> 00:00:07.381
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.181 --> 00:00:15.211
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.591 --> 00:00:21.021
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.131 --> 00:00:26.191
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:33.091
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.271 --> 00:00:37.071
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.411 --> 00:00:44.041
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:52.191
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.321 --> 00:00:59.391
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:05.631
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.641 --> 00:01:11.601
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.611 --> 00:01:19.041
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.681 --> 00:01:26.951
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:32.961
Rayearth!

00:01:35.831 --> 00:01:36.771
Selece!

00:01:38.871 --> 00:01:39.891
Windam!

00:01:41.571 --> 00:01:45.061
Oh, those Rune-Gods from
the other day are here again.

00:01:45.581 --> 00:01:47.041
What? Where?

00:01:48.511 --> 00:01:52.311
Those damn Rune-Gods sent
my cute FTO to the repair dock!

00:01:54.751 --> 00:01:55.681
What?

00:01:56.051 --> 00:01:57.821
What is that sound?

00:02:01.231 --> 00:02:02.321
That's...

00:02:16.741 --> 00:02:17.711
Alcyone!

00:02:20.511 --> 00:02:23.141
Long time no see, Magic Knights.

00:02:23.551 --> 00:02:25.141
So you're alive!

00:02:27.321 --> 00:02:30.911
There's no way the old lady's magic
will work on a Rune-God.

00:02:33.421 --> 00:02:34.551
Umi!

00:02:34.791 --> 00:02:35.451
Ms. Umi!

00:02:35.561 --> 00:02:41.521
Hikaru and Nova in the Dream

00:02:45.571 --> 00:02:46.731
Finally...

00:02:47.071 --> 00:02:51.471
Finally, I am able to retaliate against
those arrogant Magic Knights.

00:02:55.311 --> 00:02:56.441
Ms. Umi!

00:02:59.021 --> 00:03:00.851
Winds of Admonishment!

00:03:09.061 --> 00:03:09.991
Fuu!

00:03:34.991 --> 00:03:36.251
Thank goodness.

00:03:36.351 --> 00:03:38.911
I thought Umi would fall forever.

00:03:43.261 --> 00:03:44.661
Alcyone...

00:03:45.001 --> 00:03:46.331
So you're alive...

00:03:47.031 --> 00:03:49.191
I was wonderin' where she went.

00:03:49.301 --> 00:03:51.731
She's sure standin'
on some weird thing.

00:03:51.841 --> 00:03:54.771
Ascot, do you know what that is?

00:03:55.371 --> 00:03:56.811
I don't know...

00:03:57.041 --> 00:03:59.441
It's a monster
even you can't identify?

00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:01.271
I've never seen it.

00:04:01.381 --> 00:04:05.371
In the previous battle,
new creatures were probably created.

00:04:06.221 --> 00:04:08.481
Perhaps it's one of those.

00:04:08.721 --> 00:04:09.741
No...

00:04:09.851 --> 00:04:12.721
This monster doesn't feel that way.

00:04:13.591 --> 00:04:15.531
That is not from Cephiro.

00:04:24.241 --> 00:04:25.601
Take care of Umi.

00:04:25.701 --> 00:04:26.671
Right.

00:04:38.281 --> 00:04:40.581
Why did you attack, Alcyone?

00:04:41.751 --> 00:04:44.241
The war is already over...

00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:49.321
Over?

00:04:50.491 --> 00:04:52.121
It is far from over.

00:04:52.231 --> 00:04:54.531
The humiliation that I felt...

00:04:54.631 --> 00:04:56.961
That will never disappear.

00:04:57.131 --> 00:05:00.571
The treatment I received from
one I gave everything to serve...

00:05:00.671 --> 00:05:03.271
I will always remember that!

00:05:11.681 --> 00:05:12.811
Astra!

00:05:28.201 --> 00:05:29.501
Hey, hey...

00:05:29.601 --> 00:05:33.871
Why's a Rune-God of Cephiro all of
a sudden fighting that gaudy woman?

00:05:34.341 --> 00:05:35.431
Dunno...

00:05:36.371 --> 00:05:37.341
But I...

00:05:38.011 --> 00:05:41.101
...don't really like
scary-looking women like her.

00:05:43.311 --> 00:05:44.681
Why you...

00:05:44.781 --> 00:05:47.441
Aren't you the conceited little brat.

00:05:47.921 --> 00:05:49.011
You little...

00:05:49.291 --> 00:05:52.311
Even a kid can
assert his preferences!

00:05:52.521 --> 00:05:54.291
What was that?

00:05:54.391 --> 00:05:55.981
What? I can't help it!

00:05:56.091 --> 00:05:57.251
That reminds me.

00:05:57.361 --> 00:06:00.801
The voice I heard from
the Rune-God seemed to be a girl's.

00:06:02.731 --> 00:06:03.721
A girl?

00:06:04.771 --> 00:06:05.931
Was she cute?

00:06:06.041 --> 00:06:09.301
Hey, how old was she?
Is she in my age range?

00:06:09.411 --> 00:06:12.381
I don't know if she's in your age range.

00:06:12.481 --> 00:06:14.211
I did hear her voice...

00:06:14.311 --> 00:06:18.301
...but I wasn't able
to confirm what the pilot looked like.

00:06:19.521 --> 00:06:21.381
I hope she's cute.

00:06:21.491 --> 00:06:24.921
You know, I like girls with short hair...

00:06:25.861 --> 00:06:29.121
And I'd be even happier
if she was shorter than me...

00:06:29.231 --> 00:06:32.491
There really aren't
many girls shorter than you.

00:06:33.031 --> 00:06:35.691
Besides, if she's
a resident of Cephiro...

00:06:35.801 --> 00:06:38.891
...how she looks doesn't
necessarily reflect her age.

00:06:39.001 --> 00:06:43.441
Even if she looks younger than you,
she can be well over 300 years old.

00:06:45.011 --> 00:06:46.001
Oh, yeah.

00:06:46.111 --> 00:06:48.341
Since Cephiro is a world of will...

00:06:48.451 --> 00:06:53.141
...really strong-willed people
can change how old they look.

00:06:53.551 --> 00:06:55.981
I remember Lantis saying that...

00:06:58.791 --> 00:06:59.881
Lantis...

00:07:04.231 --> 00:07:05.321
Eagle.

00:07:09.671 --> 00:07:10.761
Cephiro.

00:07:11.941 --> 00:07:16.741
A country led to peace by Pillars of
each generation, who upheld all order...

00:07:16.841 --> 00:07:18.771
...with their powers of prayer.

00:07:19.911 --> 00:07:23.641
To me, Cephiro was
like a setting for fairy tales.

00:07:24.051 --> 00:07:29.321
I knew it existed, but everything
about it seemed like part of a story.

00:07:29.421 --> 00:07:31.891
It never seemed real at all.

00:07:32.361 --> 00:07:37.231
My mission is to seize control
of this country's Pillar system.

00:07:37.961 --> 00:07:41.401
It's really not my style
to invade a country.

00:07:41.801 --> 00:07:47.501
But my life has been in your hands
since I decided to stick by your side.

00:07:48.811 --> 00:07:49.901
Geo...

00:07:50.271 --> 00:07:55.011
For now, I love Eagle because
he pilots the FTO so well.

00:07:55.911 --> 00:08:00.821
I mean, only Eagle can pilot
a fighting machine so beautifully!

00:08:01.621 --> 00:08:05.921
That's why I wanted to be Eagle's
mechanic and boarded the NSX.

00:08:06.021 --> 00:08:08.791
I have no complaints
no matter what happens.

00:08:09.191 --> 00:08:11.751
Are all repairs to the FTO finished?

00:08:15.871 --> 00:08:18.801
Autozam will conquer Cephiro.

00:08:24.371 --> 00:08:25.771
Arile!

00:08:39.921 --> 00:08:45.161
Water Dragon!

00:08:55.841 --> 00:08:56.931
Umi!

00:08:57.611 --> 00:08:59.541
Umi, are you all right?

00:09:00.241 --> 00:09:01.641
I'm all right!

00:09:02.051 --> 00:09:04.511
How dare you, you old lady!

00:09:05.051 --> 00:09:06.481
You little...

00:09:11.621 --> 00:09:12.781
Alcyone...

00:09:13.391 --> 00:09:14.761
I want you to listen.

00:09:15.291 --> 00:09:16.491
W-What?

00:09:17.291 --> 00:09:19.161
Cephiro is in danger.

00:09:21.401 --> 00:09:25.161
At this rate,
this world really will fall to ruin.

00:09:25.971 --> 00:09:28.941
Lafarga, Caldina, and Ascot...

00:09:29.571 --> 00:09:31.471
They're all in the castle.

00:09:31.641 --> 00:09:32.771
Alcyone...

00:09:33.111 --> 00:09:37.881
I know you don't think highly of us
because we fought against you before.

00:09:38.481 --> 00:09:41.971
But can you at least
stay in the castle with them?

00:09:42.091 --> 00:09:44.851
That castle is made of people's will...

00:09:45.521 --> 00:09:47.961
Caldina and the others told us that.

00:09:48.161 --> 00:09:51.091
Mages, sorcerers, summoners...

00:09:51.761 --> 00:09:56.031
The castle is made by people
with exceptionally strong wills...

00:09:56.131 --> 00:09:58.571
Alcyone, you can join them and...

00:10:02.941 --> 00:10:04.031
Alcyone?

00:10:43.081 --> 00:10:45.211
What's wrong with that old lady?

00:10:45.321 --> 00:10:47.251
Something is wrong with her!

00:11:01.401 --> 00:11:06.531
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:08.411 --> 00:11:12.541
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:13.711 --> 00:11:14.841
Fools.

00:11:15.951 --> 00:11:21.281
On this path that leads only to despair,
you still try to fight to the end.

00:11:22.821 --> 00:11:24.341
This voice is...

00:11:30.861 --> 00:11:33.461
The Pillar of Cephiro is now gone.

00:11:36.671 --> 00:11:39.801
Ruin is the only thing
left for this world.

00:11:40.341 --> 00:11:42.741
The voice from my dreams...

00:11:43.441 --> 00:11:44.501
Soon.

00:11:45.811 --> 00:11:48.141
Soon everything will die.

00:11:49.051 --> 00:11:51.741
Everything will then become mine.

00:12:06.331 --> 00:12:08.301
Hello, Hikaru.

00:12:10.801 --> 00:12:11.771
Who?

00:12:14.601 --> 00:12:16.041
I am Nova.

00:12:16.311 --> 00:12:18.901
The one who was
born for you. Nova.

00:12:20.481 --> 00:12:21.941
For... me?

00:12:22.811 --> 00:12:23.751
Yes.

00:12:24.111 --> 00:12:26.841
I was born just for you, Hikaru...

00:12:27.281 --> 00:12:28.381
Nova...

00:12:28.851 --> 00:12:29.941
Soon...

00:12:30.551 --> 00:12:32.151
We'll meet soon...

00:12:32.661 --> 00:12:33.751
Hikaru...

00:12:48.211 --> 00:12:49.371
She vanished!

00:12:49.471 --> 00:12:50.601
That voice...

00:12:50.711 --> 00:12:53.511
It was not that of Ms. Alcyone.

00:12:58.011 --> 00:12:59.281
Hey, Hikaru...

00:13:00.051 --> 00:13:01.351
What's wrong, Hikaru?

00:13:01.451 --> 00:13:02.441
Hikaru!

00:13:03.521 --> 00:13:05.251
Is something the matter?

00:13:05.821 --> 00:13:08.121
You are very pale.

00:13:11.031 --> 00:13:12.261
Nothing...

00:13:12.731 --> 00:13:13.891
Hikaru...

00:13:16.401 --> 00:13:17.531
Let's go!

00:13:29.981 --> 00:13:32.311
Something not from Cephiro?

00:13:32.981 --> 00:13:35.321
What do you mean,
Master Mage Clef?

00:13:36.091 --> 00:13:37.351
I'm not sure.

00:13:37.451 --> 00:13:39.451
I don't really know...

00:13:39.991 --> 00:13:41.821
...but it just feels different.

00:13:41.931 --> 00:13:42.861
Feels?

00:13:43.391 --> 00:13:45.161
What do you mean?

00:13:45.531 --> 00:13:46.591
He's right.

00:13:46.701 --> 00:13:48.931
That isn't something from Cephiro...

00:13:53.001 --> 00:13:54.801
How can you tell?

00:13:54.911 --> 00:13:59.871
I am a fairy that is known as
an especially pretty one in Cephiro.

00:14:00.281 --> 00:14:04.181
I can tell right away that
it's not a spirit or a fairy.

00:14:04.281 --> 00:14:06.771
Then what? A new kinda creature?

00:14:07.221 --> 00:14:11.881
Even if it was new, I would know
if it was something from Cephiro.

00:14:12.461 --> 00:14:16.391
But that didn't smell anything
like something from Cephiro.

00:14:19.561 --> 00:14:22.761
I don't feel happy when
you nod in agreement, fluff ball!

00:14:28.211 --> 00:14:29.871
What are you doing?

00:14:32.641 --> 00:14:36.241
I have no idea what you are!
You're in the same boat!

00:14:38.551 --> 00:14:41.071
You're not a fairy.
You're not a creature.

00:14:41.181 --> 00:14:43.051
What in the world are you?

00:14:49.191 --> 00:14:51.181
Help me, Lantis!

00:14:52.361 --> 00:14:55.531
That evil light surrounding Alcyone...

00:14:56.331 --> 00:14:57.771
What was that...

00:14:59.401 --> 00:15:03.171
What was that aura filled
with hatred and ill feelings?

00:15:13.681 --> 00:15:16.981
Are they really going
to head out to the battleship?

00:15:17.091 --> 00:15:18.521
That reminds me...

00:15:18.861 --> 00:15:22.791
Hikaru mentioned she wanted to talk
to the people who were invading.

00:15:23.261 --> 00:15:24.321
Talk?

00:15:24.431 --> 00:15:27.591
What is she going
to discuss with the invaders?

00:15:27.701 --> 00:15:30.331
Really, what are those ladies thinkin'?

00:15:30.431 --> 00:15:32.421
Those Magic Knights...

00:15:40.341 --> 00:15:43.841
Did you feel that evil aura earlier?

00:15:45.781 --> 00:15:46.711
Yeah.

00:15:49.091 --> 00:15:51.611
Did you figure out what it was?

00:15:51.721 --> 00:15:52.651
No.

00:15:53.191 --> 00:15:55.991
I tried to trace it, but it got away.

00:15:57.691 --> 00:16:01.761
Even you, one with powers equal
that of your elder brother, Zagato...

00:16:01.871 --> 00:16:05.631
...who became high priest
of Cephiro, could not track it.

00:16:08.041 --> 00:16:10.731
The one who taught
my brother and I magic...

00:16:10.841 --> 00:16:13.311
...was you, Master Mage Clef.

00:16:15.581 --> 00:16:18.981
My magic was far
from my brother's level.

00:16:19.881 --> 00:16:21.981
You think too highly of me.

00:16:22.821 --> 00:16:27.311
You possess enough magic
to equal a high priest...

00:16:27.861 --> 00:16:31.621
...and are versed enough in the
sword to become a swordmaster.

00:16:32.101 --> 00:16:35.691
You were the only
magic swordsman here in Cephiro.

00:16:38.101 --> 00:16:42.271
Though I never thought that
you would ever leave Cephiro.

00:16:43.811 --> 00:16:46.901
If the Pillar of Cephiro
had not faded away...

00:16:47.011 --> 00:16:49.841
...I never would have
returned to this land.

00:16:50.351 --> 00:16:51.781
Does that mean...

00:16:52.051 --> 00:16:55.351
...you came back
by order of those in Autozam?

00:16:56.321 --> 00:16:57.291
Look!

00:16:57.651 --> 00:17:00.211
Something came out of the battleship!

00:17:01.021 --> 00:17:02.491
The FTO.

00:17:03.291 --> 00:17:04.731
It's Eagle.

00:17:09.971 --> 00:17:11.131
That's...

00:17:12.841 --> 00:17:14.601
He's not attacking.

00:17:14.801 --> 00:17:17.571
It is natural to think that this is a trap.

00:17:17.671 --> 00:17:18.771
I know.

00:17:19.081 --> 00:17:21.811
I don't think we can talk it out.

00:17:22.351 --> 00:17:26.081
But until I know exactly
what the other side desires...

00:17:26.421 --> 00:17:28.321
...I can't do anything.

00:17:28.421 --> 00:17:29.351
Yeah.

00:17:29.621 --> 00:17:33.851
I don't want to fight again without
knowing what the other side feels...

00:17:34.191 --> 00:17:36.621
A slight risk is inevitable.

00:17:37.161 --> 00:17:38.721
We should make sure.

00:17:38.831 --> 00:17:42.061
Properly. So that
we do not regret anything.

00:17:50.071 --> 00:17:52.061
The legendary Rune-Gods.

00:17:52.481 --> 00:17:55.171
They're completely
different from the FTO.

00:17:55.281 --> 00:17:56.111
Geo!

00:17:56.211 --> 00:17:57.371
Yes, sir?

00:17:57.481 --> 00:17:59.541
Is analysis of the Rune-Gods done?

00:17:59.651 --> 00:18:01.281
Eagle, it's awesome!

00:18:01.381 --> 00:18:03.441
Hey, don't interrupt!

00:18:03.551 --> 00:18:05.681
These Rune-God things are amazing!

00:18:05.791 --> 00:18:07.881
They're not machines! They're alive!

00:18:08.491 --> 00:18:09.421
Alive?

00:18:11.731 --> 00:18:13.991
Nothing shows up on the inside!

00:18:15.571 --> 00:18:18.331
I can't tell
what its power source is either!

00:18:18.871 --> 00:18:21.271
But I have a positive
life-form reading!

00:18:21.371 --> 00:18:22.741
They're alive...

00:18:23.441 --> 00:18:25.201
Such huge things...

00:18:25.881 --> 00:18:28.211
It really is just as Lantis said.

00:18:45.561 --> 00:18:46.551
Girls?

00:18:48.471 --> 00:18:49.401
No.

00:18:49.931 --> 00:18:53.991
I'm not supposed to judge people
from Cephiro by their appearances.

00:19:09.351 --> 00:19:11.251
I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:19:12.061 --> 00:19:13.751
Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:19:14.061 --> 00:19:15.821
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:19:22.471 --> 00:19:26.091
You said you were the highest
commander in Cephiro's invasion?

00:19:27.471 --> 00:19:28.801
That's right.

00:19:29.541 --> 00:19:31.701
We have a question to ask you.

00:19:32.081 --> 00:19:33.301
A question?

00:19:33.741 --> 00:19:36.081
The reason you're invading Cephiro.

00:19:36.711 --> 00:19:38.441
We'd like to know it.

00:19:38.551 --> 00:19:41.241
What difference
would the answer make?

00:19:41.351 --> 00:19:42.681
We want to know it.

00:19:42.791 --> 00:19:47.721
We don't want to fight anymore not
knowing what the other side wants.

00:19:48.261 --> 00:19:50.731
So we want to make sure we know.

00:19:50.831 --> 00:19:53.351
You sure make strange comments.

00:19:53.461 --> 00:19:55.231
We're not kidding.

00:19:55.731 --> 00:19:57.961
Would you mind giving us the answer?

00:19:58.471 --> 00:19:59.731
Let's see...

00:20:00.601 --> 00:20:02.041
First of all...

00:20:02.171 --> 00:20:05.071
What do you want
to do with Cephiro?

00:20:05.841 --> 00:20:07.641
We want to protect it.

00:20:07.741 --> 00:20:11.371
Until the new Pillar
emerges in Cephiro?

00:20:11.981 --> 00:20:13.071
Well...

00:20:16.821 --> 00:20:18.551
About the Pillar...

00:20:19.261 --> 00:20:22.091
We'd still like to give it some thought.

00:20:22.191 --> 00:20:23.491
Some thought?

00:20:24.161 --> 00:20:27.251
Cephiro belongs
to the people of this land.

00:20:27.361 --> 00:20:29.801
The future of this land...

00:20:29.901 --> 00:20:33.341
...should be determined
by the people who live here.

00:20:34.471 --> 00:20:35.461
What's your...

00:20:35.571 --> 00:20:38.741
I mean, your country's
purpose in invading?

00:20:39.541 --> 00:20:43.071
To get a hold of
the Pillar system itself.

00:20:43.651 --> 00:20:45.051
The Pillar system?

00:20:45.721 --> 00:20:48.081
The Pillar of Cephiro is almighty.

00:20:48.181 --> 00:20:51.881
Nothing is impossible with
the power of his or her will.

00:20:51.991 --> 00:20:54.511
Autozam wants that power.

00:20:54.721 --> 00:20:55.821
No...

00:20:56.491 --> 00:20:58.461
The Pillar isn't almighty.

00:20:58.931 --> 00:21:03.191
And so the legendary Magic Knights
who protect Cephiro and I...

00:21:04.131 --> 00:21:06.601
...are nothing other than enemies.

00:21:08.171 --> 00:21:12.111
Autozam will get
the Pillar system of Cephiro.

00:21:16.981 --> 00:21:20.581
No!

00:21:20.681 --> 00:21:21.651
What?

00:21:22.021 --> 00:21:23.881
Whose voice is that?

00:21:47.241 --> 00:21:49.181
The Pillar of Cephiro...

00:21:50.311 --> 00:21:51.941
...shall be me.

00:21:52.051 --> 00:21:54.541
I shall be the new princess.

00:22:17.871 --> 00:22:23.311
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:23.951 --> 00:22:31.221
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.691 --> 00:22:38.221
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.931 --> 00:22:42.731
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.101 --> 00:22:45.501
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.301 --> 00:22:50.601
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:50.971 --> 00:22:54.341
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.741 --> 00:23:01.671
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.091 --> 00:23:05.521
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.821 --> 00:23:14.251
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.101 --> 00:23:20.431
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.671 --> 00:23:28.741
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.811 --> 00:23:37.621
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:45.901 --> 00:23:47.991
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.661 --> 00:23:53.031
A large dragon appeared in front
of our eyes with a piercing scream.

00:23:53.141 --> 00:23:57.301
The voice from the dragon
identified herself as Aska of Fahren.

00:23:57.411 --> 00:24:02.111
Before our surprised eyes, something
like a huge dancing lion appeared...

00:24:02.211 --> 00:24:04.011
...and started to attack!

00:24:04.481 --> 00:24:06.511
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.851 --> 00:24:09.251
The Magic Knights and Aska of Fahren.

00:24:09.351 --> 00:24:09.851
The Magic Knights and Aska of Fahren

00:24:09.851 --> 00:24:11.791
The Magic Knights and Aska of Fahren
You have to watch it!

00:24:11.791 --> 00:24:13.361
The Magic Knights and Aska of Fahren

00:24:13.361 --> 00:24:20.291
Who is it today?

00:24:21.331 --> 00:24:23.091
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:23.371 --> 00:24:23.901
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.901 --> 00:24:26.741
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.741 --> 00:24:28.241
Look forward to the next episode!
See you later!

00:24:28.241 --> 00:24:29.331
Look forward to the next episode!
